  - name: Bareos Backup Count Low
    detail: An unusually low number of backups have completed 
    fluxfile: flux/bareos_job_count.flux
    severity: 1
    threshold: 10.0
    comparison: lt
    tags: 
      - host
      - _field
      - _measurement
    cron: "0 6 * * *"
    target: xapi
    action: | 
              There may be a problem with the backups running on cibccaprodadm1. Fewer job than
              expected have completed by the end of the mnormal backup window (6am).
              Log in to the server and the bareos console. Check the status of the failed, running and waiting backup. 
              Escalate if there are many jobs waiting on a long running job. Investigate why the
              job is stalled by reviewing the job logs. 
